{
  "description": "[being built] OIDC trust entries (contracts/identity-and-authz.md#oidc-api-keys-being-built). entries: whether org-api accepts a bot's OIDC trust entry (subject, claims) for a provider's issuer; valid false is 400 invalid_request, reason is for people, not compared. match: whether an entry matches a token org-api has already verified (signature, iss, aud, exp, nbf): * in subject is any run of characters, including none, everything else matches itself, and the whole sub must match; each claims condition must equal the token's claim exactly, a string as itself and a number or boolean as its JSON text. Reference implementation: scripts/lib/oidc-trust.mjs.",
